'''Sunfish Jones''' (マンボーグ鈴木, ''Manbōgu Suzuki'', '''Manborg Suzuki''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]].

